sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Planner
  participant O as Optimizer
  participant X as AsyncEvalExec
  participant F as Provider function
  participant E as Endpoint
  P->>O: resolved plan with ApplyAsyncFunctionExpression
  O->>O: ExtractAsyncFunctions to EvalAsyncFunctions node
  O->>O: push LIMIT and safe child filters below the node
  P->>X: physical plan with AsyncEvalExec
  loop per input row (bounded)
    X->>F: produceResultAsync(row), non-blocking
    F->>E: provider request
  end
  E-->>F: responses complete in any order
  F-->>X: futures complete
  X-->>P: emit rows in input order
